# M0.5 source-map regression guard: the original file line (15) must
# appear in the diagnostic.  Under CC_PRE_EXPAND=1 the diagnostic
# currently reports the post-pre-expand line (~56) because the source
# map is not threaded through the visitor diag path — a known M1 gap.
# Pin this test to the default pipeline; once the M1 visitor refactor
# lands and source maps survive pre-expand, drop this override.
CC_PRE_EXPAND=
